      "source": "atlas",
      "author": "Atlas",
      "authorId": "atlas",
      "text": "I'm looking at whether we can adapt Claude's SDK approach to create a custom wrapper around the Codex SDK, giving Atlas more flexibility with hooks, middlewares, and system prompts. First I need to dig into how Codex is currently integrated here and what constraints we're hitting. I'll spin up parallel agents to investigate how Atlas currently integrates the Codex SDK and what extensibility points it actually provides compared to Claude's SDK, then pull in any relevant context from memory about this.",
      "kind": "thinking",
      "createdAt": "2026-07-13T22:44:14.399+00:00"
    },
    {
