      "authorId": "atlas",
      "text": "I'll ground myself before weighing in. This is an architecture/feasibility question, so let me first see how Atlas actually uses the Codex SDK today, and separately pin down what the Codex SDK vs Claude's SDK really expose. Let me kick off that investigation in parallel.",
      "kind": "chat",
